Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:2px">Epipolar geometry of a stereo pair</div>
<div style="font-size:11px;color:#444;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:4px">
